sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Timer as Timer / message trigger
    participant Job as Job in command layer
    participant Create as CreateOrderCommand
    participant Reserve as ReserveStockCommand
    participant HTTP as HTTP entry point
    Timer->>+Job: Trigger-specific input
    Note over Job: Rejected: scheduling / trigger concerns enter the command layer
    Job->>+Create: Nested dispatch through pipeline
    Create-->>-Job: Order ID
    Job->>+Reserve: Nested dispatch with Order ID
    Reserve-->>-Job: Result
    Job-->>-Timer: Completion
    Note over HTTP,Job: HTTP needs this process without the trigger-specific contract; otherwise it duplicates the sequence
